            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "minds of consumers, the brand "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          358.9060928571429,
          345.0883081947744,
          10.982142857142833,
          9.62303355106883
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEJI+NissanAG-MediumItalic",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          374.10245000000003,
          345.0883081947744,
          93.17837436974787,
          9.62303355106883
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the company. "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          362.1315017814728,
          357.99440617647065,
          9.623033551068715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "So everything we do to define and position our brand,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          379.1747075415677,
          320.4047448319328,
          9.62303355106883
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to make it more powerful and compelling, yields"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          396.217828087886,
          339.2076376890757,
          9.623106591448959
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "immense value for our employees, our dealers and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          413.261033847981,
          351.2557977731093,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "suppliers, and most importantly for our shareholders"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          430.304203087886,
          360.3372977731093,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and other stakeholders. That in turn manifests itself in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          447.3473601543943,
          327.783315,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "higher sales, better margins and lower marketing"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          464.3905293942993,
          350.5734061764706,
          9.623070071259008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "costs, elevated levels of customer trust, better word-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          481.4336864608076,
          329.5857990336135,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of-mouth communication, and better advocacy in "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          498.4768557007126,
          110.95478054621853,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the marketplace."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          171.38527315126052,
          515.520012767221,
          259.1946768487395,
          9.623070071258837
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "After the Alliance was created, the new"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          532.563182007126,
          352.1621906302522,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "management team came in and made several critical"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          549.606351247031,
          351.99379777310924,
          9.623070071258837
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "decisions. One was a call to clearly define Nissan as "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          566.6495083135392,
          343.8597078571429,
          9.623070071258951
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "a global brand. The message was clear. Nissan was"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          583.6926775534442,
          345.6739234033614,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "not going to be a supplier of commodity automotive"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          600.7358346199526,
          359.73985197479,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "appliances. We are building cars that capture people’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          617.7790038598575,
          341.43771037815134,
          9.623070071258951
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "imaginations. Cars that are fun to drive, that people"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          634.8221609263658,
          343.0792263445378,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "want to drive. Cars that might not be for everyone—"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          651.8653301662707,
          341.89024357142864,
          9.623070071258951
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "that could even prove polarizing in their design and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          668.9084994061758,
          347.10888894957986,
          9.623057897862225
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "performance characteristics—but cars impossible to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          685.9516564726841,
          233.29585197479,
          9.623070071258837
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ignore, cars that quicken the pulse."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          171.38527315126052,
          702.9948257125891,
          330.2345155042017,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Well, our team got the product right, and it’s up to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          720.0380071258908,
          189.5957091176471,
          9.623070071258894
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEHF+NissanAG-Medium",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "us to get the branding right. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.96977659663864,
          754.1233352137767,
          346.0780490336135,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
